          "settings": {
            "heading": "30-Day Guarantee",
            "content": "<p>We know tights can be delicate. If your Sofneu tights are damaged during normal wear within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>, we’ll provide a <strong>one-time free replacement</strong>.</p><p>Simply contact us with your <strong>order number and a photo of the damage</strong>. You won’t normally need to return the damaged tights.</p><p><strong>Your replacement and replacement shipping are both free.</strong></p><p>The guarantee does not cover deliberate damage, improper use or care, lost products, or repeated claims after the one-time replacement has been used.<br/></p>",
